      "lineRange": [52, 248],
      "summary": "Trains a single student's policy network end-to-end: sets up optimizer and loss, optionally resumes from a checkpoint, loops over epochs computing train/test losses per data split, saves periodic and final checkpoints, runs mid-training flight deployment evaluations, and selects the best checkpoint based on evaluation loss.",
      "tags": ["training", "checkpointing", "evaluation", "pipeline"],
      "complexity": "complex"
    },
